    parentName: "pre",
    "className": "language-markdown"
  }, "Assume the role of an expert in using computational linguistics technologies in the digital humanities. Please read the uploaded paper as a PDF and be prepared to answer my questions about it.\n")), mdx("blockquote", null, mdx("p", {
    parentName: "blockquote"
  }, "I've reviewed the paper titled \"Text Mining Tafsir: Compilation and Preliminary Explorations of a Curated Corpus of 80 Qur\u02BE anic Commentaries\" jdir-article-p97_4.pdf. The authors introduce a curated corpus of 80 Arabic Tafsir (tafs\u012Br) works compiled as part of a project investigating the development of Qur\u02BE anic WAY metaphors. They present systematic quantitative and qualitative characteristics of the Tafsir corpus and its metadata, and demonstrate the potential of computer-driven analyses of the Tafsir corpus through a clustering of selected subchapters and sentences.")), mdx("blockquote", null, mdx("p", {
    parentName: "blockquote"
  }, "The paper discusses the importance of Tafsir as a genre, its history, and its doctrinal diversification. The authors highlight the challenges of working with a large corpus of Tafsir texts, including issues with bibliographical information, unknown editions, and the absence of metadata. They also discuss the process of corpus compilation, data cleaning, and normalization.The authors present an exploratory data analysis of the corpus, including an overview of the chronological distribution of the Tafsirs, regional distribution, and corpus bias. They also analyze the distribution of quotes in the Tafsir works, including Qur\u02BE anic, Hadith, and poetry quotes.")), mdx("blockquote", null, mdx("p", {
    parentName: "blockquote"
  }, "One of the key findings is that the corpus contains a significant number of quotes from various sources, with some Tafsirs having a high absolute number of quotes and others having a low quote count. The authors also identify a specific subcategory of Tafsirs, namely popularizing Tafsirs, which tend to contain fewer direct quotations.")), mdx("blockquote", null, mdx("p", {
    parentName: "blockquote"
  }, "The paper also presents a case study on clustering selected subchapters and sentences from the Tafsir corpus using text mining methods. The authors use a pre-trained language model to create document embeddings and apply HDBSCAN to cluster the data. They identify several clusters of semantically similar Tafsir subchapters and sentences, including a cluster discussing the concept of the \"road to hell\" and another cluster discussing the value of sincerity.")), mdx("h4", {
