  }, "Application of text mining methods: They apply text mining methods, specifically clustering algorithms, to identify semantic groups of Tafsir subchapters and sentences that discuss Qur\u02BE anic verses containing the term \u1E63ir\u0101t (\"road\" or \"way\")."), mdx("li", {
    parentName: "ol"
  }, "Distant-reading approach: They demonstrate the feasibility of a distant-reading approach to analyze the Tafsir corpus, which involves analyzing large amounts of text without humanly reading each individual text."), mdx("li", {
    parentName: "ol"
  }, "Insights into Tafsir literature: They aim to provide new insights into the development of Qur\u02BE anic metaphors, specifically the metaphor of the \"straight and solid road\" (\u1E63ir\u0101t al-mustaq\u012Bm), and how it was explicated and developed in various manners in the Tafsir literature.\nOverall, the authors propose that computational linguistics technologies can be effectively used to analyze large corpora of Tafsir texts, gain new insights into the development of Qur\u02BE anic metaphors, and shed light on the evolution of Tafsir literature."))), mdx("h4", {
