    parentName: "pre",
    "className": "language-markdown"
  }, "What is the motivation for this research?\n")), mdx("p", null, "Note: When I reworded the assignment question in my own words, \"What is the authors' motivation in producing this research\" and it returned almost the same answer as for the prompt: \"Please tell me what are the authors proposing.\"."), mdx("blockquote", null, mdx("p", {
    parentName: "blockquote"
  }, "The motivation for this research is threefold jdir-article-p97_4.pdf:"), mdx("ol", {
    parentName: "blockquote"
  }, mdx("li", {
    parentName: "ol"
  }, "Investigate Qur\u02BE anic WAY metaphors: The authors aim to examine the development of Qur\u02BE anic WAY metaphors, specifically the metaphor of \"guidance on the straight/solid road (al-\u1E63ir\u0101t al-mustaq\u012Bm)\" and its explications within selected exegetical works in Arabic and Persian."), mdx("li", {
    parentName: "ol"
  }, "Introduce a curated corpus of Tafsir works: The authors seek to introduce a curated corpus of 80 Arabic Tafsir (tafs\u012Br) works, which can serve as a valuable resource for future research on the Tafsir tradition."), mdx("li", {
    parentName: "ol"
